@startuml
!include ../../../../../../../tooling/styles/plantuml/behavioral/state-machine-diagram-style.iuml
title Approval lifecycle
[*] --> DRAFTED
DRAFTED --> APPROVED : decide approve
DRAFTED --> REJECTED : decide reject
APPROVED --> Executed : execute and record
REJECTED --> [*]
Executed --> [*]
legend right
  Arrow: transition
  [guard]: condition
endlegend
@enduml
